=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play updates/edited ------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Auto Updates screen proposed for slice$
# 7, drawn from what real code reads of a simulated host (the$
# Auto Updates check, apt-config, dpkg, systemctl,$
# alpine.ReadUpdates), each change on the real plan/apply$
# engine: alpine.PlanUpdates and packages.PlanInstall as built,$
# the rest of each direction and the record the gallery's stand-$
# ins, unit (b)'s to build. Nothing on this machine changes:$
# every command and file is the fake's.$
$
# Info: updates/edited$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. by-hardn-debian, then$
# hardn's file edited by hand. Disable refuses, naming it.$
$
# Auto Updates #################################################$
$
  [+] Auto Updates         Configured unattended-upgrades$
$
# Update Configuration -----------------------------------------$
$
   -  unattended-upgrades  Installed 2.12$
   -  Upgrades             Daily by 52hardn-auto-upgrades$
   -  Package Lists        Daily by 52hardn-auto-upgrades$
   -  Upgrade Timer        On apt-daily-upgrade.timer$
   -  Lists Timer          On apt-daily.timer$
   -  Turned on by         hardn record of 2026-10-20$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Disable automatic updates$
      Undo hardn's changes$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 1$
$
# Warning$
# Not undone: /etc/apt/apt.conf.d/52hardn-auto-upgrades changed$
# since hardn wrote it. Put it back as it was or undo the rest$
# by hand.$
$
# Auto Updates #################################################$
$
  [+] Auto Updates         Configured unattended-upgrades$
$
# Update Configuration -----------------------------------------$
$
   -  unattended-upgrades  Installed 2.12$
   -  Upgrades             Daily by 52hardn-auto-upgrades$
   -  Package Lists        Daily by 52hardn-auto-upgrades$
   -  Upgrade Timer        On apt-daily-upgrade.timer$
   -  Lists Timer          On apt-daily.timer$
   -  Turned on by         hardn record of 2026-10-20$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Disable automatic updates$
      Undo hardn's changes$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

